#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186289213 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "288e49b0-f706-54de-86b7-a17248fe2408" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Parallelogram Spanned by Two Non-Parallel Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "556b4699-a3ea-5c69-88e0-00ec44a76a53" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186289215}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "556b4699-a3ea-5c69-88e0-00ec44a76a53" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186289215} :answer-field/id #uuid "c7167cb4-32e2-5cbc-a1bf-ff0a4c445670" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186289214}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "d3f06126-dd7a-58be-a1a3-c69ca4cf1a54" :question/math-academy-id "q-275539" :question/problem "Determine the area $A$ of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]$ and $\\text{v}=[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}].$\n\n$\\,\\,A=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =1\\cdot (-1)-4\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =-9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,-9\\,|=9\n$$"}]}
